Place "apple" into words.
Place "banana" into words.
Keep a shared queries as an empty list of text.
Place "Kiwi" into queries.
Place "kiwi" into queries.
Place "Apple" into queries.
Place "apple" into queries.
Place "Banana" into queries.
Place "banana" into queries.
Keep a shared lowers as an empty list of text.
Keep a shared vowels as an empty list of text.
Keep a shared source as empty text.
Keep a shared built as empty text.
Keep a shared letter as empty text.
Keep a shared smallpiece as empty text.
Keep a shared vowelmark as empty text.
Place "a" into vowelmark.
Keep a shared capitals as empty text.
Place "ABCDEFGHIJKLMNOPQRSTUVWXYZ" into capitals.
Keep a shared smallletters as empty text.
Place "abcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxyz" into smallletters.
Keep a shared wanted as empty text.
Keep a shared lowerquery as empty text.
Keep a shared vowelquery as empty text.
Keep a shared found as 0.
Keep a shared wordlast as 0.
Keep a shared querylast as 0.
Keep a shared chosen as 0.
To lowerpiece.
Set smallpiece to letter.
For every spot from 0 to 25.
The capitalpiece is the slice of capitals from spot to spot plus 1.
If letter matches capitalpiece, set smallpiece to the slice of smallletters from spot to spot plus 1, return.

To lowertext.
Set built to the slice of source from 0 to 0.
The last is the number of characters in source minus 1.
For every spot from 0 to last.
The piece is the slice of source from spot to spot plus 1.
Set letter to piece.
Lowerpiece.
Place smallpiece into built.

To markletter.
Set smallpiece to letter.
If letter is "a", set smallpiece to vowelmark, return.
If letter is "e", set smallpiece to vowelmark, return.
If letter is "i", set smallpiece to vowelmark, return.
If letter is "o", set smallpiece to vowelmark, return.
If letter is "u", set smallpiece to vowelmark, return.

To voweltext.
Set built to the slice of source from 0 to 0.
The last is the number of characters in source minus 1.
For every spot from 0 to last.
The piece is the slice of source from spot to spot plus 1.
Set letter to piece.
Markletter.
Place smallpiece into built.

To seekexact.
Set found to -1.
For every spot from 0 to wordlast.
If item spot of words matches wanted, set found to spot, return.

To seeklower.
Set found to -1.
For every spot from 0 to wordlast.
If item spot of lowers matches lowerquery, set found to spot, return.

To seekvowel.
Set found to -1.
For every spot from 0 to wordlast.
If item spot of vowels matches vowelquery, set found to spot, return.

To report.
Set chosen to found.
The place is chosen.
If chosen is at least 0, show item place of words.
If chosen is less than 0, show "none".

Set wordlast to the last position of words.
For every spot from 0 to wordlast.
Set source to item spot of words.
Lowertext.
The copy is a copy of built.
Place copy into lowers.
Set source to item spot of lowers.
Voweltext.
The second is a copy of built.
Place second into vowels.

Set querylast to the last position of queries.
For every spot from 0 to querylast.
Set wanted to item spot of queries.
Set source to wanted.
Lowertext.
Set lowerquery to a copy of built.
Set source to lowerquery.
Voweltext.
Set vowelquery to a copy of built.
Seekexact.
If found is less than 0, Seeklower.
If found is less than 0, Seekvowel.
Report.
